[h1]Keep the right amount — in stacks your pawns can actually use[/h1]

Storage Group Quotas adds [b]per-item limits[/b] to vanilla storage groups. Linked shelves are counted together as one group.

It is especially useful for ammo depots: instead of one huge pile that everyone may wait to reserve, you can keep several real stacks as separate pickup targets.

The quota list uses a familiar category tree. Set values for a broad category, refine them on a child category, and override only exceptional items. In Similar stacks mode, the per-stack limit and maximum stack count inherit independently. The quota tree refreshes with the vanilla allowed-item list while open, and both windows share category folding.

[h2]Choose the mode you need[/h2]
• [b]Entire storage count[/b] — Keep no more than X of each item type in this group. Best for medicine, meals, and anything where only the total matters.

• [b]Similar stacks ×N[/b] — Keep at most X items per stack and at most N physical stacks. X and N can be inherited or overridden independently. This is useful for ammunition from mods such as Combat Extended; for example, 25 × 4 gives a total capacity of 100 across up to four stacks.

With some hauling or reservation optimization mods, one physical stack may be reserved by only one pawn or job at a time. Multiple stacks provide separate reservation targets and can reduce queues when several weapons reload or are resupplied together.

[h2]What happens to excess items?[/h2]
• Incoming hauling respects the group's remaining quota.

• Existing excess is moved by normal hauling jobs — never deleted or teleported.

• With Hauler's Dream or Pick Up And Haul active, a pawn can collect several nearby total-count overflow stacks from the same source group into inventory. Every pickup and drop is rechecked against the live quota, so the part that should remain on the shelf is not taken. Hauler's Dream keeps its own smart-overload and Combat Extended weight/bulk rules.

• Haulers first use valid storage outside the group. If none exists, they place the excess on a reachable floor cell outside the group.

• In Similar stacks mode, haulers first try to split or consolidate stacks inside the group. Anything that cannot fit the selected layout is moved outside.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
Select a shelf or stockpile → click [b]Quotas[/b] → choose a mode → set values for categories or individual items in the tree. In Similar stacks mode, [b]Per-stack quota[/b] and [b]Max stacks[/b] are configured independently. The global defaults at the top are optional; unset children inherit the nearest configured parent for each field.

[b]Important:[/b] category values are calculated separately for every descendant item. A category N gives each item its own N-stack allowance; it is not one shared stack pool. In Entire storage mode, 0 means unlimited. In Similar stacks mode, 0 per stack uses that item's current stack limit, while max stacks is at least 1. The mod does not change ThingDef.stackLimit globally.

[h2]Requirements and compatibility[/h2]
• RimWorld 1.6

• [b]Requires Harmony[/b]

• Works with Combat Extended ammunition; Combat Extended is not required

• Optional quota-aware batch support for Hauler's Dream and Pick Up And Haul, with vanilla hauling as the safe fallback

• If both hauling mods are active, SGQ uses Hauler's Dream only; Hauler's Dream is designed to replace Pick Up And Haul

• [b]Incompatible with Stack Gap[/b] — disable it first; its settings are not migrated

[url=https://github.com/Steel-Shadow/RimWorld-StorageGroupQuotas]Source code, full documentation, and issue tracker[/url]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]存得刚刚好，也让小人真正取用得到[/h1]

Storage Group Quotas（存储组配额）为原版存储组增加[b]按物品分别计算的数量上限[/b]。链接在一起的物品架会作为一个整体统计。

它尤其适合弹药库：与其让所有小人等待同一个可能已被预留的大堆，不如保留多个真实堆栈，提供彼此独立的取用目标。

配额列表采用熟悉的分类树：可以先给大类设置数值，再在子类中细分，只覆盖少数例外物品。在“类似堆栈 ×N”模式中，每堆上限和最大堆数分别独立继承。配额树在窗口打开期间会随原版允许物品列表刷新，两个窗口也会共享分类折叠状态。

[h2]选择需要的模式[/h2]
• [b]整个仓库数量[/b] — 该组内每种物品最多保留 X 件。适合药品、食物等只关心总数的物品。

• [b]类似堆栈 ×N[/b] — 每堆最多 X 件，最多保留 N 个真实堆栈；X 和 N 可分别继承或覆盖。它适合管理来自其他模组的内容，例如 Combat Extended 弹药；25 × 4 表示最多四堆、总容量 100。

在部分搬运或预留优化模组下，一堆实体物品同时可能只能被一个小人或任务预留。多个堆栈能提供彼此独立的预留目标，减少多件武器同时换弹或补给时的排队。

[h2]超量物品会去哪？[/h2]
• 新的入库搬运不会超过存储组的剩余配额。

• 已经超量的物品会由小人通过正常搬运移走，不会被删除或瞬移。

• 启用 Hauler's Dream 或 Pick Up And Haul 时，小人可以把同一来源存储组内附近的多堆“总量超额”物品按负重批量装入库存。每次拾取和卸货都会重新核对实时配额，不会顺手搬走物品架上本应保留的部分。Hauler's Dream 会继续使用自身的智能超载及 Combat Extended 重量／体积规则。

• 搬运工会优先送到该组之外的合法仓储；没有可用仓储时，则放到该组外可到达的地面。

• 在“类似堆栈 ×N”模式中，搬运工会先尝试在组内拆分或归并；无法纳入所选布局的部分会移到组外。

[h2]使用方法[/h2]
选择物品架或储存区 → 点击[b]存储配额[/b] → 选择模式 → 在分类树中为分类或单个物品设置数值。在“类似堆栈 ×N”模式中，[b]每堆上限[/b]和[b]最大堆数[/b]分别设置。窗口顶部的全局默认值只是可选的继承基准；未设置的子项会为每个字段分别继承最近的父级。

[b]请注意：[/b]分类值会由每种后代物品分别计算；分类 N 表示每种物品各自拥有 N 个堆位，并不是整个分类共享 N 堆。“整个仓库数量”模式下，0 表示不限；“类似堆栈 ×N”模式下，每堆上限为 0 时使用该物品当前的堆叠上限，最大堆数则至少为 1。本模组不会全局修改 ThingDef.stackLimit。

[h2]需求与兼容[/h2]
• RimWorld 1.6

• [b]需要 Harmony[/b]

• 可用于 Combat Extended 弹药，但不强制依赖 CE

• 为 Hauler's Dream 与 Pick Up And Haul 提供可选的总量超额批量搬运适配；无法使用时会安全回退原版搬运

• 若两个搬运模组同时启用，SGQ 只使用 Hauler's Dream；Hauler's Dream 本身用于替代 Pick Up And Haul

• [b]与 Stack Gap 不兼容[/b] — 请先禁用；旧配置不会迁移

[url=https://github.com/Steel-Shadow/RimWorld-StorageGroupQuotas]源代码、完整说明与问题反馈[/url]
